{"availability":"available","full":"lutelute/All-Japan-Grid","name":"All-Japan-Grid","description":"Open Japanese power grid geographic topology from OpenStreetMap","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-03T18:39:46Z","updated":"2026-10-10T15:00:44Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://lutelute.github.io/All-Japan-Grid/","topics":[],"demo":"https://lutelute.github.io/All-Japan-Grid/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.115Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.115Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.115Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.115Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[](CHANGELOG.md) []( [](docs/MODELINTERVENTIONS.md) []( [](LICENSE)","日本全国の送電網を、出典つきで見る・確かめる・使う。 OpenStreetMap から機械的に組み立て、事業者の公表資料で突き合わせた全国の送電網モデルです。 地図で眺めるだけでなく、潮流が解け、変電所の中まで描け、災害で何が起きるかを試せます。 どの仮定をどこに置いたかは、すべて台帳で追えます。","規模 — OSM から抽出: 送電線 40,087 本・変電所 6,962 か所・発電所 19,138 か所(10 地域)。潮流計算に使う正典モデル(docs/data/built/)は 17,841 ノード・19,529 枝。モデルに加えた仮定は介入台帳に 44 件。リリース v1.8.0・配布データセット v1.7.0。 / Scale — extracted from OSM: 40,087 lines, 6,962 substations, 19,138 plants across 10 regions. The canonical model used for power flow has 17,841 nodes and 19,529 branches; 44 modelling assumptions are listed in the intervention registry. Release v1.8.0, dataset v1.7.0."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lutelute/All-Japan-Grid/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"020cd404a787fee594b777a2561b89ac77117540bd62d340c4977adb09fb0f04","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.269Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.269Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[](CHANGELOG.md) []( [](docs/MODELINTERVENTIONS.md) []( [](LICENSE)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lutelute/All-Japan-Grid/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"020cd404a787fee594b777a2561b89ac77117540bd62d340c4977adb09fb0f04","sourceUrl":"